{code}

items.fromString:
If there is following present

 
{code:java}
context: /test
alias: something
{code}
and we send another enable-app command with

 
{code:java}
context: /test
alias: something,somethingelse
{code}
the second alias is ignored.

Instead, it should be added to the existing alias.

